        ["Portfolio.Apprenticeship.Context.Title"] = "Context",
        ["Portfolio.Apprenticeship.Context.Description"] = "Since the BUT INFORMATIQUE is a three-year program, the second and third years can be completed through an apprenticeship. The apprenticeship aims to obtain the degree while working in a company during project periods and vacations, which allows you to gain experience and learn what school cannot teach. In my case, my contract started on July 1, 2024 and ends on August 31, 2026. The company is 3MO Performance, located in Laval. I work as a software developer.",
        ["Portfolio.Apprenticeship.Company.Title"] = "Core business",
        ["Portfolio.Apprenticeship.Company.Description"] = "3MO Performance is an SME with about 70 employees. Their core business is the production of competitive automotive gearboxes. Several types of gearboxes are offered for sale: gear-ratio gearboxes, sequential gearboxes, and gearboxes for recreational and commercial electric vehicles. Specifically, 3MO designs, produces, assembles, and tests its own product lines. Several motorsport fields are covered, such as rally, sport prototype & GT, off-road, touring, rallycross, electric & hybrid. 3MO has worked with many prestigious clients such as Renault Group, McLaren, Valeo Arquus, Dallara (F3), and Alpine (A110).",
        ["Portfolio.Apprenticeship.Missions.Title"] = "Missions",
        ["Portfolio.Apprenticeship.Mission1.Title"] = "Development of complementary applications to SAGE ERP",
        ["Portfolio.Apprenticeship.Mission1.Description"] = "Create software linked to Sage databases to manage inventory, replicate and add operations, and eliminate the use of Excel.",
