        ["Portfolio.Scratch.Game3.Title"] = "Calculator Race",
        ["Portfolio.Scratch.Game3.Description"] = "Calculator Race was coded in math class! Calculator Race is both a game and a utility, because you can either use the calculator or play the calculation race. If you play the calculation race, you can earn a mystery cube that lets you pass through anything for 10 seconds by pressing the spacebar! To access the menu, press \"M\". Have fun!",
